METHOD:: defaultAllowedFiles
Default: ["rtf","rtfd","sc","scd","html","HTML","schelp"]

METHOD:: defaultOpenAction
a default function you can set for all  items.

{|path,action,what,val| doSomething()}

METHOD:: defaultLazyLoad
default: true. Preload the submenus. Makes menu items more respnsive.  Caution: can slow things down with large directories.


INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: allowedFiles
Default: ["rtf","rtfd","sc","scd","html","HTML","schelp"]


METHOD:: openAction
a function run on the selected path. Typically open a file.

{|path,action,what,val| doSomething()}

for action,what,val, see link::Classes/Menu::

You can set it on the instance, or you can set a default with  PathActionMenu.defaultOpenAction


